1.Install husky and setup 

  1.1 npx husky-init && npm install       # npm
  
  
2.Install and configure prettier to work correctly with eslint

  2.1 npm install --save-dev --save-exact prettier
  
  2.2 npm install --save-dev eslint-config-prettier
  
  2.3 Add the prettier in the extends array in eslintrc.cjs 
  
  	  extends: [
		    'eslint:recommended',
		    'plugin:@typescript-eslint/recommended',
		    'plugin:react-hooks/recommended',
		    "prettier"
			  ],
